links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int { return is 1 { 1 -> 40 } }
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1", "console.stdout", "console.stderr"]
stage: "resolve"
code: "source.pattern-nonexhaustive"

### Notes

PATTERN-BIND 穷尽性: a VALUE-producing `is` without an else/complete
cover is the frozen `bind/source.pattern-nonexhaustive` rejection — the
auto face relaxes exhaustiveness only for the fall-through STATEMENT
form (see statement-fallthrough).

## Case: statement-fallthrough
id: "av.parity.1083.statement-fallthrough"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "patterns"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    var hit = 0
    let x = 5
    is x {
        1 -> { hit = 1 }
    }
    return hit
}
```

