## Case: fn-tail-is-value
id: "av.parity.1083.fn-tail-is-value"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "patterns"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn check(c int) int {
    return is c {
        1 -> 10
        2 -> 20
        else -> 0
    }
}
fn main() int { return check(1) + check(2) + check(9) }
```

